      <activity id="c45ee4e6-00ae-5356-9e3b-0ed8d01b26ee" activityNameId="9b2965ee-f349-539a-bfcc-002c9acf4926" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, control and wiring, central unit</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, control and wiring, central unit
Disposal of the basic control unit for central ventilation equipment with 720 m3/h nominal air flow. Electrical wiring for connection of unit and grid connection. Weight of control unit 0.6 kg, weight of wiring 4.2 kg. Electrical wiring for connection of unit;
UUID: e1c045a8-dc31-4c39-bf3f-2bd33fe077a6
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces and copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2003. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e1c045a8-dc31-4c39-bf3f-2bd33fe077a6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
